[[16,96,16384,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The control unit of the AISIN electronic\nautomatic transmission \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              monitors and governs the entire\nautomatic transmission management system.</p><p>The control unit is supplied directly by\nthe battery via the line of maxifuse O/A located on the battery\n(connector \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99 D</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ), at pin 12 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply controlled by the ignition (15/54)\narrives at pin 25 of connector A of M55 from the line protected\nby fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B42</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pins 2 and 8 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\nearthed.</p><p>The control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is connected\nto the selector lever position sensor located on the gearbox (unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nconnector A): the unit receives an ignition-controlled supply (INT)\nat pin 9, while pin 10 is earthed.</p><p>From pins 3, 6, 8 and 11 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               connector\nA emerge the signals corresponding to P, R, N and D respectively,\nwhich are connected to control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , at pins 3 and 16\nof connector A and 7 and 16 of connector B.</p><p>Pin 2 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               connector A gives a\nsafety signal (gear in N or P) for the starting enablement relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J05</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\ngives the starting enablement: pin 50 of the starter motor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>A20</strong><a href=\"#/3234399\">E5010</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               - connector\nA - is also connected to the solenoids assembly \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               - connector\nB - which contains the control valves, pressure regulator and some\nsensors; the solenoid control signals come from pins 13 (for the gear\nchange solenoid L1), pin 26 (for the gear change solenoid L2), pin\n26 (for the torque converter lock solenoid L-UP) and pin 15 (for\nthe solenoid E/B); pin 11 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               supplies\nthe pressure control solenoid, whose control signal comes from pin\n1 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; pins 5 and 18 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               connect\nto the oil temperature sensor located next to the solenoids in \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pins 4  and 12 of connector B \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\nconnected to the car speed sensor (gearbox output) \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K77</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pins 3 and 11 of connector B \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\nconnected to the gearbox speed input sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K78</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; pin 2 of\nconnector B \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               provides  the signal screening earth.</p><p>Pin 9 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives\nthe signal coming from the stop lights switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>l30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , with the\nsupply controlled by the ignition (INT) from fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98 B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>This signal controls the locking of the\ntorque converter (L-UP).</p><p>The gear controls assembly \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H37</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives\nan ignition-controlled supply (15/54) and is connected to the control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               to indicate the gear engagement request: these signals\nare sent to pins 13, 8, 10, 15 and 14 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\n pin 7 of the connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives the P engaged signal.</p><p>The selector\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H49</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              is for selecting\nthe various operating modes;  it receives an ignition-controlled\nsupply (15/54) and is connected to control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               at pin 5\nof connector  B (SPORT/CITY function) and pin 14 of connector B\n(ICE function).</p><p>The control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               manages a series\nof safety checks: shift lock (lever locked if ignition is not on\nMAR and brake pressed); it sends a signal from pin 21 of connector\nA to the speed control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H37</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; key lock (key locked if\nthe gear selector is not set to P): sends a signal from pin 20 of\nconnector A which controls the lock electromagnet \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               incorporated\nin the ignition switch; doors open buzzer: the signal that the driver&#x27;s\ndoor is open - lock \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               - reaches pin 6 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\nthe command for the buzzer, located in the instrument \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nis sent from pin 10 of connector A; the same line also sends signals for\nthe display and for the &#x27;automatic transmission fault&#x27; warning light.\noil overheating: if the gearbox oil is overheating (detected by\nthe sensor in the above-mentioned unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ), a command is\nissued from pin 19 of connector A to the specific relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J86</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (supplied\nunder ignition control (15/54) via the line protected by the fuse\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nlocated in the additional fuse box  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98 A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) which controls\nthe appropriate fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N49</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is equipped with\na self-test system that may be used by connecting the unit to connector \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : this receives signals from pin 23 connector A of control\nunit\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . the serial line is shared with the engine control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is connected to\nthe engine management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and the ABS control\nunit  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . This connection is via the CAN line from pins 1\nand 9 of connector B of  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , through the steering sensor\nto pins 12 and 29 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]